  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that using imagenet_vit_l as the image encoder (config_031) outperforms resnet50 (config_004). This experiment tests whether switching the RNA encoder from scgpt (used in config_031) to scvi_n200 while keeping the image encoder, aggregation (avgpool), and fusion (weighted) the same would improve performance. This isolates the impact of RNA encoder choice with the already validated image encoder, helping resolve uncertainty about which RNA representation is better under the optimal image encoder."
